00:02:57.620 --> 00:03:00.693
And in order to wake up feeling
refreshed and energized,

00:03:00.693 --> 00:03:02.110
your body temperature
actually has

00:03:02.110 --> 00:03:04.088
to increase by about
1 to 3 degrees.

00:03:04.088 --> 00:03:06.130
With Eight Sleep, you can
program the temperature

00:03:06.130 --> 00:03:08.480
of your sleeping environment
in the beginning, middle,

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:09.483
and end of your night.

00:03:09.483 --> 00:03:10.900
It has a number
of other features,

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:12.760
like tracking the amount
of rapid eye movement

00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:14.135
and slow wave
sleep that you get,

00:03:14.135 --> 00:03:16.150
things that are essential
to really dialing

00:03:16.150 --> 00:03:17.692
in the perfect
night's sleep for you.

00:03:17.692 --> 00:03:19.567
I've been sleeping on
an Eight Sleep mattress

00:03:19.567 --> 00:03:21.040
cover for well
over two years now.

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:23.240
And it has greatly
improved my sleep.

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:24.760
I fall asleep far more quickly.

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:27.100
I wake up far less often
in the middle of the night.

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:29.110
And I wake up feeling
far more refreshed

00:03:29.110 --> 00:03:32.320
than I ever did prior to using
an Eight Sleep mattress cover.

