00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:49.690
Today's episode is also
brought to us by LMNT.

00:03:49.690 --> 00:03:52.510
LMNT is an electrolyte drink
that has everything you need

00:03:52.510 --> 00:03:53.510
and nothing you don't.

00:03:53.510 --> 00:03:55.400
That means plenty of
electrolytes-- sodium,

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:57.738
magnesium and
potassium-- and no sugar.

00:03:57.738 --> 00:04:00.280
The electrolytes are absolutely
essential for the functioning

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:01.492
of every cell in your body.

00:04:01.492 --> 00:04:02.950
And your neurons,
your nerve cells,

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:05.170
rely on sodium,
magnesium and potassium

00:04:05.170 --> 00:04:07.660
in order to communicate with
one another electrically and

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:08.260
chemically.

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:10.390
LMNT contains the optimal
ratio of electrolytes

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:12.700
for the functioning of
neurons and the other cells

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:13.330
of your body.

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:15.640
Every morning, I drink a
packet of LMNT dissolved

00:04:15.640 --> 00:04:17.620
in about 32 ounces of water.

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:19.839
I do that just for
general hydration

00:04:19.839 --> 00:04:22.150
and to make sure that I
have adequate electrolytes

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:23.620
for any activities that day.

00:04:23.620 --> 00:04:26.620
I'll often also have an LMNT
packet, or even two packets,

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:30.550
in 32 to 60 ounces of water
if I'm exercising very hard

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:32.770
and certainly if I'm
sweating a lot, in order

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:34.900
to make sure that I
replace those electrolytes.

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:36.640
If you'd like to
try LMNT, you can go

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:41.350
to drinklmnt.com/huberman to
get a free sample pack with

00:04:41.350 --> 00:04:42.050
your purchase.

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:45.700
Again, that's
drinklmnt.com/huberman.

