01:06:33.710 --> 01:06:36.233
I've long been a believer in
getting regular blood work done

01:06:36.233 --> 01:06:38.650
for the simple reason that
many of the factors that impact

01:06:38.650 --> 01:06:40.240
your immediate and
long-term health

01:06:40.240 --> 01:06:43.103
